        }
      ],
      "content": "lambfell / lambskin: the skin or fleece of a lamb, used as fur; traded white or black, tawed (dressed) or undressed, and from Ireland, Spain, Britain etc. (the skin of a lamb that died by disease or accident is a morkin)."
    }
